{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong><i>Blue Ridge Hunting</i></strong>, team up with friends to investigate, document, and take down these terrifying creatures lurking in the shadows. Explore expansive, open-world maps inspired by real locations across the Appalachian region, and come face-to-face with some of its most feared and mysterious beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/f2bbb0a912e688c86f9af867342bbfa8.poster.avif?t=1769566326\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/f2bbb0a912e688c86f9af867342bbfa8.webm?t=1769566326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/bdbd7c8896de67c70d8d1b553a01bec3.avif?t=1769566326\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras_big/bdbd7c8896de67c70d8d1b553a01bec3.webp?t=1769566326 width=1560 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Appalachian Mountains are steeped in some of America's most chilling folklore, home to legendary cryptids and unexplained phenomena. Step into the boots of the Appalachian Investigation Group, a team dedicated to tracking these elusive creatures. Using a range of tools and equipment, gather evidence, follow the clues, and embark on high-stakes hunts based on real sightings and local legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn money from successful investigations and upgrade your gear at Levi\u2019s cabin to take on even greater threats. But beware: you're not alone out there. These creatures are always watching... and listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/5a35081d83ad4e75750214861c6384b4.poster.avif?t=1769566326\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/5a35081d83ad4e75750214861c6384b4.webm?t=1769566326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/ce2c4bb5a5dbed0b3b32f4a86d4c1def.avif?t=1769566326\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras_big/ce2c4bb5a5dbed0b3b32f4a86d4c1def.webp?t=1769566326 width=1560 height=258 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found Footage:</strong> A gritty retro/PSX art style inspired by early 3D horror and analog media.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always Listening:</strong> Creatures react to proximity voice chat and radio chatter. Communication is crucial, but dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Into the Woods, Solo or Together:</strong> Explore the Appalachian wilds alone or with up to 5 players in online co-op freeplay mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bump In The Night:</strong> A narrative-driven story (1\u20133 players) following the Appalachian Investigation Group\u2019s hunt for the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience The Legends:</strong> Face unique, intelligent creatures based on real Appalachian legends and folklore.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark-Bluegrass Symphony:</strong> An original score that blends haunting melodies with Appalachian roots, amplifying the tension and tone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/2026ab5160b7d84c4c7e2ba2aa9d94f8.poster.avif?t=1769566326\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/2026ab5160b7d84c4c7e2ba2aa9d94f8.webm?t=1769566326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2434930?t=1769566326","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2434930?t=1769566326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/1c027df56a0db97a46d6593f0db48abd52ddbe6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769566326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/1c027df56a0db97a46d6593f0db48abd52ddbe6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769566326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"May contain content not appropriate for all ages, including horror, gore, alcohol and drug abuse, and discussions and/or depictions of traumatic events."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4089260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong><i>Blue Ridge Hunting</i></strong>, team up with friends to investigate, document, and t